# Buried in the Garden on an opponent's land: "its controller adds an additional one mana of any color", and its controller is
# the enchanted land's, whoever controls the Aura. Turn 3: Bot1 enchants Bot2's Forest (the Aura's controller has no legal
# exile target: Bot2 controls only lands, so the enters trigger is removed). Turn 4: Bot2 taps the Forest and chooses red
# itself: Bot2 has {G}{R} and Bot1, the Aura's controller, has no mana. Bot2's other land is not enchanted and taps for one mana.

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Buried in the Garden
Island
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Mountain
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Buried in the Garden.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Forest)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Buried in the Garden.AttachedTo = Forest
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
? Bot2.Mana = {R}
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Colors(Red)
? Bot1.Mana =

[Expect]
Turn = 4
Bot2.Mana = {R}{R}{G}
